      "english": [
        "Questioning strategies",
        "Research understanding",
        "Benefit and affect (mixed)",
        "Answer demands and worksheet"
      ],
      "selection_reason": "K=4 is an auxiliary discovery model pooling R1-3 Q3 with R4 Q4. The changed question mixes affect and limited-benefit wording. It is not evidence of longitudinal change in learning."
